Z||000013||DecadenceR||07-01-2001||02:54 AM||||I just changed my 84 to a later decklid because every time it rained, the water went right onto the exhaust manifold, and I didnt' want it to crack. That, and it would fog up my rear window pretty bad.||||reg||1
